{%- comment -%}
  Luma Pause custom cursor: rose dot + trailing ring.

  Markup is server-rendered rather than JS-injected so it exists at first
  paint. Styles live in assets/luma-custom-cursor.css and behavior in
  assets/luma-custom-cursor.js - keep them there rather than inlining copies
  here, so there is a single source of truth for this component.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="luma-cursor-dot" id="LumaCursorDot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="luma-cursor-ring" id="LumaCursorRing" aria-hidden="true"></div>
